WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.162
As a Chinese man—especially a science guy—I’m not exactly great with words.

2
00:00:05.112 --> 00:00:08.600
Saying all this in Chinese might sound a bit cheesy,

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.862
so I thought… maybe English will work better.

4
00:00:11.862 --> 00:00:18.112
We started off long-distance, got married in Shenzhen, then we had our daughter, and settled down together.

5
00:00:18.112 --> 00:00:20.587
Time really flies, right?

6
00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:24.650
The other day, you told me our 10th anniversary is coming up.

7
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.837
Damn, 10 years.

8
00:00:26.837 --> 00:00:30.837
Ten years… that’s 10 times 365 days.

9
00:00:30.837 --> 00:00:32.362
Crazy.

10
00:00:32.362 --> 00:00:38.300
I swear, I’ve never ever gotten tired of just holding you and kissing you, not even for a second.

11
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.337
If I had to count…

12
00:00:40.337 --> 00:00:43.850
I’m pretty sure I’ve kissed you at least once every day.

13
00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:48.150
That’s over 3,650 kisses in 10 years!

14
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.937
Damn, you still look amazing.

15
00:00:50.937 --> 00:00:54.237
Even without makeup, you look fantastic.

16
00:00:54.237 --> 00:00:57.400
Some people even think you’re still a student.

17
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:03.187
But it’s not just your looks, it’s your kindness, your strength, and the way you make our home feel so warm.

18
00:01:03.187 --> 00:01:05.862
Yeah, you have a lot of fans.

19
00:01:05.862 --> 00:01:08.100
Your students adore you.

20
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.637
Honestly, I think I’m starting to get jealous of them!

21
00:01:11.637 --> 00:01:14.587
Honestly, if I were your student…

22
00:01:14.587 --> 00:01:17.125
I’d probably be a fan too.

23
00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:19.975
Yeah, I’m one of your biggest fans.

24
00:01:19.975 --> 00:01:23.637
I love the way you smile, especially when you see me.

25
00:01:23.637 --> 00:01:28.025
That little lift at the corners of your mouth, It gets me every time.

26
00:01:28.025 --> 00:01:30.337
I love our nights together.

27
00:01:30.337 --> 00:01:35.312
I get to hold you while we sleep, and in the morning, I get to smell your sweet scent.

28
00:01:35.312 --> 00:01:37.787
It’s the best part of my day.

29
00:01:37.787 --> 00:01:41.200
You look incredible in your work uniform too.

30
00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.100
I love watching you focus at work—you’re so good at what you do.

31
00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.412
You’re so independent.

32
00:01:47.412 --> 00:01:51.975
You don’t interrupt me when I’m on my phone, and you don’t mind working late.

33
00:01:51.975 --> 00:01:55.712
You’re always there for me and the family, no matter what.

34
00:01:55.712 --> 00:02:00.562
Of course, We argue sometimes, but you’re always the easy one to make up with.

35
00:02:00.562 --> 00:02:04.087
Good food, a hug, and everything’s right again.

36
00:02:04.087 --> 00:02:07.437
That’s just one of the many things I love about you.

37
00:02:07.437 --> 00:02:09.562
We’ve grown together.

38
00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:11.662
We’ve laughed together.

39
00:02:11.662 --> 00:02:14.350
We’ve faced challenges together.

40
00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:17.050
Let’s keep being the best damn team.

41
00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:19.175
Here’s to our future:

42
00:02:19.175 --> 00:02:23.825
no matter what comes, we’ll always walk through it together, hand in hand.

43
00:02:23.825 --> 00:02:26.837
Let’s make the next 10 years even better.

44
00:02:26.837 --> 00:02:28.537
More trips.

45
00:02:28.537 --> 00:02:30.412
More memories.

46
00:02:30.412 --> 00:02:32.100
More love.

47
00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.675
I love you !
